@startuml 
title HiBA-AB 使用流程泳道圖

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam activity {
  BorderColor #3B4252
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF7D6
  DiamondBorderColor #8A6D1D
  StartColor #2F855A
  EndColor #2B6CB0
}

|Admin / Operator|
start
:開啟 Claw Dashboard;

if (是否有新節點待註冊?) then (是)
  |RPi Agent|
  :開機後執行 announce;
  :收集 hostname / IP / MAC / publicKey;
  :POST /api/nodes/announce;

  |Accounting Server|
  :寫入 TrustRegistry;
  :節點狀態 = pending;
  :推送 SSE node:announce;

  |Admin / Operator|
  :審核節點資訊;
  :按下 Approve / Register;

  |Accounting Server|
  :更新 TrustRegistry;
  :節點狀態 = registered;
  :推送 SSE node:registered;

  |RPi Agent|
  :啟動輕量 Agent;
  :開始 heartbeat;

  |Accounting Server|
  :執行 capability probe;
  :分類 node profile;
  :節點狀態 = profiled / online;
else (否)
endif

|Admin / Operator|
:輸入自然語言任務;
:送出執行要求;

|Claw Dashboard|
:POST /api/plan;
:附帶 X-Agent-Id / X-Trace-Id / X-Depth;

|AgentServer|
:建立 ToolContext;
:呼叫 NLPlanningService.plan(task, ctx);

|Accounting Server|
:listNodeResources();
:回傳各節點資源清單;

|Planner / LLM|
:讀取 task、resources、availableTools;
:產生 ExecutionPlan;
:以 Zod 驗證 PlanStep;

if (ExecutionPlan 是否有效?) then (否)
  |AgentServer|
  :回傳 plan parse failed;
  |Claw Dashboard|
  :顯示規劃錯誤;
  stop
else (是)
endif

|Claw Dashboard|
:顯示 ExecutionPlan;
:使用者確認執行;

repeat
  |AgentServer|
  :取出下一個 PlanStep;

  |ResourceDecisionService|
  :clear checker cache;

  if (toolbox.has(toolName)?) then (否)
    |NodeCapabilityChecker|
    :canInstall(nodeId, ctx)?;

    if (可安裝?) then (是)
      |HiBA Toolbox|
      :install / register tool;
      :準備執行 tool;
    else (否)
      |HiBA-B / Broker Layer|
      :封裝 SignedTask;
      :dispatch 到可處理節點;
      |RPi Agent|
      :接收任務並執行;
    endif

  else (是)
    |NodeCapabilityChecker|
    :isStale(nodeId, toolName, version)?;

    if (版本過期?) then (是)
      |HiBA Toolbox|
      :update tool;
      :重新 register;
    else (否)
    endif

    |HiBA Toolbox|
    :execute(toolName, input, ctx);
  endif

  |Trust / Security|
  :驗證 AgentIdentity / permission;
  :必要時使用 TPM 簽章或驗章;

  if (驗證或權限是否通過?) then (否)
    |AuditTrail|
    :記錄失敗 ToolResult;
    |AgentServer|
    :依 supervisorPolicy 中止或保留部分結果;
  else (是)
    |AuditTrail|
    :記錄成功 ToolResult;
    :保存 traceId / stepId / agentId;
  endif

repeat while (還有下一個 PlanStep?) is (是)

|AgentServer|
:彙整所有 ToolResult;
:回傳任務結果;

|Claw Dashboard|
:更新畫面與執行狀態;
:顯示 audit proof / error message;

|Admin / Operator|
:檢視結果與稽核紀錄;
stop

@enduml
